        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe, keep you waiting？
Have you been a good boy？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, you know... It might've
been a while since we walked
side by side like this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe so... Sorry.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I was pretty lonely~.
As your punishment, give me
lots of attention, okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Replaying my memories...
Like when we went to Atami
together.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Atami, huh...
Yeah, that was such a great time...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wonder what you're
remembering？ As for me,
I remember everything
from start to finish.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Everything？ That's amazing.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, I was with you the whole
time, after all. I remember
every single thing.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>…………。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm~？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's my line.
Staring like that...
see something you like？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Not really...
I wasn't staring, was I？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You totally were... Geez.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, could it be you've fallen
head over heels for your newly
gorgeous older girlfriend？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey, I was just teasing, don't
take it so seriously. Giving me
such an intense look...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Do I really look that serious？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You definitely do. Come on,
let me get a good look at
your face.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Look right at me,
from the front.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Don't pull away.
Come closer, okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Geez, that's too close!
Bad boy.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>There we go, I can see you
well. Now give me a smile~？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, smile？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yep, great smile!
A hundred points!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hm? Are you embarrassed？
Well, you were cute,
so that's fine.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What is it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I was just thinking...
There's really nobody around...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And what do you want to do
about that？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's as far as we go for now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe... Because—</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We've got plenty more memories
to make from now on.
So let's take it slow, okay？</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
